#. name of box generator
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "GridfinityTrayLayout"
msgstr "Bandeja Gridfinity a medida"

#. description of GridfinityTrayLayout
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "A Gridfinity Tray Generator based on TrayLayout"
msgstr "Un generador de bandejas Gridfinity basado en la bandeja a medida"

#. long description of GridfinityTrayLayout in markdown
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"This is a general purpose gridfinity tray generator.  You can create\n"
"somewhat arbitrarily shaped trays, or just do nothing for simple grid\n"
"shaped trays.\n"
"\n"
"The dimensions are automatically calculated to fit perfectly into a\n"
"gridfinity grid (like the GridfinityBase, or any other Gridfinity\n"
"based base).\n"
"\n"
"Edit the layout text graphics to adjust your tray.\n"
"You can replace the hyphens and vertical bars representing the walls\n"
"with a space character to remove the walls.  You can replace the space\n"
"characters representing the floor by a \"X\" to remove the floor for\n"
"this compartment.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Este es un generador de bandejas Gridfinity de uso general. Puedes crear\n"
"bandejas con formas casi arbitrarias o no tocar nada para obtener simples\n"
"bandejas de rejilla.\n"
"\n"
"Las dimensiones se calculan automáticamente para que encajen a la perfección\n"
"en una rejilla Gridfinity (como la base Gridfinity o cualquier otra base\n"
"basada en Gridfinity).\n"
"\n"
"Edita el esquema de texto para ajustar tu bandeja.\n"
"Puedes sustituir por un espacio los guiones y las barras verticales que\n"
"representan las paredes para eliminarlas. Y puedes sustituir por una «X» los\n"
"espacios que representan el suelo para quitar el suelo de ese compartimento.\n"

msgid "GridfinityTrayLayout Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes de la bandeja Gridfinity a medida"

#. help for parameter h
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "height in mm or add 'u' at the end for Gridfinity units"
msgstr "altura en mm, o añadir «u» al final para usar unidades Gridfinity"

#. help for parameter hi
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid ""
"inner height of inner walls in mm (leave to zero for same as outer walls "
"with optional reduction for stacking)"
msgstr "altura interior de las paredes interiores en mm (dejar a cero para igualarla a las paredes exteriores, con una reducción opcional para el apilado)"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
