#. name of box generator
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid "PaperBox"
msgstr "Caja de papel"

#. description of PaperBox
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Box made of paper, with lid.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Caja de papel, con tapa.\n"

#. long description of PaperBox in markdown
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"This box is made of paper.\n"
"\n"
"There is marks in the \"outside leftover paper\" to help see where to fold\n"
"(cutting with tabs helps use them). The cut is very precise, and could be "
"too tight if misaligned when glued. A plywood box (such as a simple "
"TypeTray) of the same size is a great guide during folding and gluing. Just "
"fold the box against it. Accurate quick and easy.\n"
"\n"
"A paper creaser (or bone folder) is also useful.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Esta caja se hace de papel.\n"
"\n"
"En el papel sobrante del exterior hay marcas que ayudan a ver por dónde plegar\n"
"(cortar con lengüetas facilita usarlas). El corte es muy preciso y puede quedar demasiado justo si se desalinea al encolar. Una caja de contrachapado del mismo tamaño (por ejemplo, una bandeja de compartimentos sencilla) es una guía estupenda para plegar y encolar: basta con plegar la caja contra ella. Preciso, rápido y sencillo.\n"
"\n"
"También viene bien una plegadera.\n"

msgid "PaperBox Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes de la caja de papel"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid "design"
msgstr "diseño"

#. help for parameter design
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid ""
"different design for paper consumption optimization. The tuckbox also has "
"locking cut for its lid."
msgstr "diseño alternativo para optimizar el consumo de papel. La caja con solapas incluye además un corte de cierre para la tapa."

#. possible choice for design
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid "automatic"
msgstr "automático"

#. possible choice for design
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid "widebox"
msgstr "caja ancha"

#. possible choice for design
#: boxes/generators/paperbox.py
msgid "tuckbox"
msgstr "caja con solapas"

